<title>PORTUGAL: Trade in Portugal's S.Costa interrupted.</title>
<headline>Trade in Portugal's S.Costa interrupted.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in shares of Portuguese construction company Soares da Costa was interrupted on Lisbon bourse, a bourse spokesman said.  </p>
<p>Semanario Economico weekly newspaper reported that Portuguese construction firm Teixeira Duarte may have agreed to buy Soares da Costa.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
